//x.com/OneLaserHQ"]],legal:[["Privacy Policy",`${Se}/policies/privacy-policy`],["Terms of Service",`${Se}/policies/terms-of-service`]]},cr={image:`${Se}/cdn/shop/files/onelaser-us-headquarters.webp?v=1788363337`,title:"Make better with one.",text:"Ownership is backed by a U.S. company, local guidance, training, official policy coverage, and technical support after delivery.",points:[["U.S. company and local team","An accountable OneLaser team for sales, service, and product guidance in the U.S."],["Training that gets work moving","One-on-one training and knowledge resources help teams move from setup to real jobs."],["Warranty and easy returns","Official warranty coverage and a 30-day return policy provide a clearer ownership path."],["Technical support after delivery","Support continues through real technicians, service resources, and available parts."]]},pc=[{id:"friday",tab:"Black Friday",eyebrow:"Ends Cyber Monday, Nov 30",title:"Black Friday Deals",text:Ka.headline,image:"home-bf-lineup.jpg",cta:"Shop Black Friday Deals",href:Ka.link},{id:"xrf",tab:"XRF",eyebrow:"Flagship desktop laser",title:"XRF 38W",text:"All-in-one RF power for fine engraving and everyday production.",image:"home-hero-xrf.jpg",video:"home-hero-xrf-loop.mp4",cta:"Explore XRF",to:"/products/onelaser-xrf-desktop-laser-machine"},{id:"vertigo",tab:"VertiGo",eyebrow:"Built for drinkware",title:"VertiGo",text:"Built-in vertical rotary for tumblers, bottles and more.",image:"home-product-vertigo-scene.webp",cta:"Explore VertiGo",to:"/products/vertigo-vertical-laser-engraver"},{id:"about",tab:"About Us",eyebrow:"About Us",title:cr.title,text:"Laser machines for creators, backed by a U.S. team.",image:"home-hero-brand-poster.webp",video:"home-hero-brand-loop.mp4",cta:"Schedule a Sales Call",to:ta.call}],Oy=[["What is the return policy?","OneLaser offers 30-day easy returns. See the Refund Policy on 1laser.com for conditions."],["What warranty is included?","X Series (XRF, XT) and Hydra: 3-year mechanical parts, 2-year electrical components, 1-year optics and laser source. Cobra: 1-year mechanical and electrical (optical lenses not covered). VertiGo: 1-year mechanical and electrical, 6-month laser source, 1-month lens and mirror."],["Where can I get help choosing?","Book a free sales consultation call or contact U.S.-based support from the Support page."]],Nn=["lightburn-software-pro-license-key","engineer-1-on-1-training-support"],Ay={xrf:["onelaser-x-series-riser-base","onelaser-automatic-conveyor-feeder","multi-function-rotary-axis-57-motor","filtrabox-micro",...Nn],vertigo:["filtrabox-micro",...Nn],cobra:["onelaser-industrial-chiller-for-hydra-laser-engraver","multi-function-rotary-axis-57-motor","piburn-omni-for-onelaser","filtrabox-compact-x",...Nn],hydra:["multi-function-rotary-axis-57-motor","piburn-omni-for-onelaser","filtrabox-compact-x","2-inch-focal-lens-laser-engraver",...Nn]},Ly=[{handle:"onelaser-xrf-desktop-laser-machine",description:"38W RF desktop laser.",badge:"Best Seller"},{handle:"cobra-8-90w-co2-laser-engraver-cutter",description:"90W CO₂ workshop laser.",badge:"NEW"},{handle:"hydra-7-gen-2-70w-rf-co2-dual-laser-machine",description:"70W air-cooled RF laser."},{handle:"vertigo-vertical-laser-engraver",description:"Vertical laser for drinkware."}],Ry=[{label:"Accessories",types:["Rotary Attachments","Fume Extractors"],image:"home-category-accessories.webp",to:"/collections/accessories"},{label:"Materials",types:["Acrylic Sheets","Leatherette"],image:"home-category-materials.webp",to:"/collections/materials"}],Fy=[{id:"LG3wz6y-tOE",title:"Engraving a bamboo cutting board",creator:"Peachy Creations",model:"XRF 38W",preview:"home-maker-bamboo.webp"},{id:"0gGxQMZZhOs",title:"Making leather patch hats",creator:"Wrico Goods",model:"Hydra 9",preview:"home-maker-leather.webp"},{id:"sk-OcNSGa1o",title:"Engraving a batch of tumblers",creator:"Woodwork by Allan",model:"Hydra 7",preview:"home-maker-tumblers.webp"}],Ty=["onelaser-xrf-desktop-laser-machine","vertigo-vertical-laser-engraver"],Ey=[{id:"detail",label:"XRF 38W",title:"Keep the details that matter.",text:"A 0.07 mm laser spot on the XRF 38W brings out fine lettering, intricate logos, and photo detail.",image:"home-why-xrf-samples.webp",alt:"XRF engraving samples on wood, crystal, and leather",cta:"Explore XRF",to:"/products/onelaser-xrf-desktop-laser-machine"},{id:"production",label:"Hydra Gen2",title:"Make room for bigger orders.",text:"The 70W RF Hydra 7 Gen2 engraves at up to 2,000 mm/s. Larger Hydra models give you more bed space for big pieces and batches.",image:"home-product-hydra-gen2-scene.webp",alt:"Hydra Gen2 in a woodworking shop",cta:"Explore Hydra Gen2",to:"/collections/hydra-gen2"},{id:"support",label:"U.S.-based support",title:"Get help from laser specialists.",text:"Our U.S. team can help you choose a machine, get set up, and troubleshoot issues after delivery.",image:"home-why-onelaser-team.webp",alt:"The OneLaser team gathered around a laser machine at an event",cta:"Contact the OneLaser team",href:`${Se}/pages/contact-us`}],Sm="Submit requests within 30 days of delivery. Eligibility, restocking fees, and shipping terms apply.",My=[{icon:"user",title:"1-on-1 training",text:"A paid, one-hour video session with a OneLaser engineer covers machine setup, software, and troubleshooting.",href:`${Se}/products/engineer-1-on-1-training-support`},{icon:"shield",title:"Warranty by model",text:"X Series and Hydra have 3 years on mechanical parts, 2 on electrical, and 1 on optics and laser-source parts. Cobra and VertiGo have separate terms.",href:`${Se}/pages/warranty-policy`},{icon:"refresh",title:"Returns and exchanges",text:Sm,href:`${Se}/pages/refund-policy`}],Dc=[["Which machine is right for me?","Answer the six questions in “Find your machine” above, compare every model side by side, or schedule a call with a OneLaser engineer."],["What warranty is included?","X Series (XRF, XT) and Hydra: 3-year mechanical parts, 2-year electrical components, 1-year optics and laser source. Cobra: 1-year mechanical and electrical (optical lenses not covered). VertiGo: 1-year mechanical and electrical, 6-month laser source, 1-month lens and mirror."],["Can I return a machine?",Sm],["Is financing available?","Yes. OneLaser works with Shop Pay Installments, Affirm and ClickLease. Rates and terms depend on the lender's approval."],["Which software does it work with?","OneLaser machines work with LightBurn, MakerBoost AI and RDWorks on Windows and macOS."],["How does support work after I buy?","You talk to U.S.-based engineers who have built, tuned and repaired these machines. Contact them from the Support page."],["How much is shipping?","The shipping rate and delivery estimate are shown at checkout once you enter your address. See the Shipping Policy for details."]],aa={average:"4.92",count:90,url:"https://www.1laser.com/pages/testimonials",items:[{name:"Thomas M Eichhorn",rating:5,productHandle:"onelaser-xrf-desktop-laser-machine",product:"XRF 38W",date:"May 2026",verified:!0,text:"I absolutely love this laser. And for the record, I have four other lasers, none of which are OneLasers. If I had the funds, I would replace several of the other lasers I have with OneLasers. Tech support is fantastic and quick to respond, material quality is great."},{name:"Chris Vaughn",rating:5,productHandle:"onelaser-hydra-9-laser-engraving-machine",product:"Hydra 9",date:"May 2025",verified:!1,text:"Finally got to use my glass tube (100w) in my Hydra 9 today! Man what a difference it makes when cutting! So much faster and reliable to cut! Really stoked on my purchase with this machine"},{name:"Jack Anderson",rating:5,productHandle:"onelaser-xt-desktop-laser-machine",product:"XT",date:"Mar 2025",verified:!1,text:'The magnetic lens assembly is a lifesaver! Cleaning the lens takes seconds, and the autofocus nails precision every time. The 12x24" bed handles large plywood cuts smoothly. Perfect for small shops needing pro results without the hassle!'},{name:"Emily R.",rating:5,productHandle:"onelaser-hydra-16-cabinet-dual-laser-system-with150w-glass-tube-and-38w-rf-metal-tube",product:"Hydra 16",date:"Mar 2025",verified:!1,text:"Needed a laser that could keep up with my growing business, and this one delivers. The airflow control makes a huge difference, no more annoying burn marks. Super happy with it!"},{name:"James Kirk",rating:5,productHandle:"onelaser-xrf-desktop-laser-machine",product:"XRF 38W",date:"Jun 2026",verified:!0,text:"I started out with a Full Spectrum K40 style, upgraded to a GlowForge, dabbled with some blue diode lasers, but the XRF is amazing. Smooth, solid, relatively quiet, accurate. I love it! Puts the joy back into creating."}]},pr={url:"https://www.trustpilot.com/review/1laser.com",score:"4.2",count:86,asOf:"Nov 18, 2026",stars:[[5,65],[4,6],[3,4],[2,6],[1,5]],items:[{name:"Jason Olsen",productHandle:"onelaser-xrf-desktop-laser-machine",rating:5,date:"May 21, 2026",verified:!0,title:"Everything from sales (Lex answered all…",text:"Everything from sales (Lex answered all of my questions over the phone before I purchased) to technical support! Tech support is not only here in America but the team is dedicated and passionate and it shows! Tech support either picks up and answers, or calls me right back, typically within an hour. They helped walk me through setting up my new XRF and navigation of LightBurn which helped get me up in running fast! I also absolutely love the new XRF laser too! It runs about 4 times faster than my S1 diode laser while engraving hat patches and also shows up way darker on my leather hat patches. …"},{name:"Heather",productHandle:"onelaser-xrf-desktop-laser-machine",rating:5,date:"Sep 17, 2026",verified:!0,title:"I had been researching lasers for a few…",text:"I had been researching lasers for a few years and was very impressed with the One Laser XRF when it first appeared on the market. Fast forward to 2026 and I finally decided to take the plunge. One Laser has been nothing short of spectacular with any questions or concerns I have. They are top notch and always make me feel important. I’m still learning and have yet to complete my first project but support has been second to none. Thank you One Laser and Murphy (you are amazing!)."},{name:"Greg Nelson",rating:5,date:"Oct 25, 2026",verified:!0,title:"1laser is doing things right. Tech support is awesome!!",text:"I was very pleased when I had a tech call with you guys. The tech “ Sean “ was very helpful as I needed help setting up the conveyor/feeder. He was very knowledgeable, helpful and patient with me as I am a newbie. I’m confident that when I need help again I’ll be sure to ask for him. Thanks for the help Sean. Greg"},{name:"Joe Mustar",productHandle:"onelaser-xrf-desktop-laser-machine",rating:5,date:"Jul 4, 2026",verified:!0,title:"I looked at a lot of desktop Co2…",text:"I looked at a lot of desktop Co2 machines for maybe 6 months. We run 2 diodes and needed to upgrade which supplied the push needed. I settled on the OneLaser XRF after seeing the LA Hobby Guy and Bearded Builds both talk so highly of it. I ordered it and it came within a reasonable amount of time, delivered right to my garage door. After about an hour of reading and assembly of the base the machine was set on it and running. …"},{name:"Steve Griggs",productHandle:"onelaser-xrf-desktop-laser-machine",rating:5,date:"Jul 10, 2026",verified:!0,title:"Everything related to my XRF has been…",text:"Everything related to my XRF has been great, the minor bumps have been my oversight, fit and finish are excellent, easy to work with and results have been excellent. Definitely recommend this laser, looking forward to seeing the nxt advancement !"},{name:"Robert Parkhill",productHandle:"onelaser-xrf-desktop-laser-machine",rating:5,date:"Aug 18, 2026",verified:!1,title:"Solid company - great product",text:"I purchased my XRF in May 2026. It arrived as scheduled with only minor issues that were quickly resolved. … DO NOT EXPECT everything to go smoothly. That's unrealistic. No company is perfect but it's obvious this company is working hard to deliver a top experience. Once everything was assembled and the machine was operative, all has gone well. I recommend the company without hesitation. …"},{name:"David F",productHandle:"onelaser-xrf-desktop-laser-machine",rating:4,date:"May 14, 2026",verified:!0,title:"Why I bought the XRF and my first experiences",text:"There are a few things that brought me to ordering the OneLaser XRF. 1) the RF CO2 laser 2) Desk top size 3) The bed size 4) Speed. … I like having the RF tube because I'm able to run the laser at higher power and not having any water cooling. The laser dot size is actually better than my diode laser. … There does remain one issue that I am having with the auto focus. … In all, I am pleased with the function of the laser."},{name:"Evan Neal",rating:5,date:"May 14, 2026",verified:!0,title:"The team helped me get a replacement…",text:"The team helped me get a replacement part, even through I bought the machine secondhand. I really appreciate it!"},{name:"Edoardo DEPINE Poffo",rating:5,date:"Jun 9, 2026",verified:!0,title:"Great customer support.",text:"Great customer support. They provide instructions in videos and photos on how to troubleshoot the issues. Strongly recommend the brand."},{name:"Mark Lee",rating:5,date:"Aug 14, 2026",verified:!0,title:"First class experience",text:"First class experience. Not sure what you are paying Murphy, but he deserves a raise!"},{name:"Guills785",rating:5,date:"Nov 2, 2026",verified:!0,title:"No doubt this have to be one of the…",text:"No doubt this have to be one of the best laser in the market for sure . I don't regret it one second."},{name:"Josia Timothy",rating:5,date:"Apr 20, 2026",verified:!1,title:"Highly recommended",text:"The customer service was great and being able to chat to someone before buying was even better!"}]},q=({to:o,href:c,children:h,...u})=>c?t.js